# SAML Identity Provider Certificate
# Download from your IdP admin console (Google Workspace, Okta, Azure AD, etc.)
# Save the PEM-formatted certificate to: saml_idp_certificate.pem
#
# Example format:
# -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
# MIIDdTCCAl2gAwIBAgIJAKz... (base64 encoded certificate)
# -----END CERTIFICATE-----

